<title>UK: SuedwestLB ups three-year bond to 200 mln stg.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB ups three-year bond to 200 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 200 million stg from 175 million stg, joint lead managers HSBC Markets and PaineWebber said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The step-up callable deal was launched on Monday.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTLB CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON    *7.25	MATURITY   *11.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.10	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+31 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT GILT DUE 1999</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER TWO YEARS AFTER WHICH COUPON</p>
<p>		STEPS UP TO 7.75 PERCENT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
